        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for integrating with a hosted LLM service. The first step is to implement the initial file `summarize_text.py` using Google's AI services. I will use the Google Cloud AI platform for this purpose. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. I will ensure that each file imports the necessary Google Cloud AI libraries and uses specific model identifiers where applicable. The local helper files will provide configuration and utility functions to support the scored files. </thinking>\n",
